C Arrays (Statically Allocated) 
• Can initialize like: 
▫ int data[] = {0, 1, 2}; //Compiler figures out size 
▫ int data[3] = {0, 1, 2}; 
▫ int data[3] = {1}; // data[0] = 1, rest are set to 0 
▫ int data[3]; //Here, values in data are still junk 
data[0] = 0; 
data[1] = 1; 
data[2] = 2; 
