Dynamic Deallocation 
• #include <stdlib.h> 
• free declares the memory pointed to by a 
pointer variable as free for future use: 
char * str = (char *) malloc( 3 * sizeof(char) ); 
strcpy(str, “hi”); 
... use str ... 
free(str); 
